Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Alternative Indirect Evolution Schemes (Evolution1)", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"540da79c-0371-9e4c-81c5-68a1122fb09b"],

Cell["\<\
Using the exact same spin system and preparation/mixing blocks, Evolution1 \
lets you replace free t1 evolution with split refocusing or constant-time \
schemes:
  1. Evolution1 -> None: conventional free evolution for total time t1; J_HN \
evolves during t1, splitting the F1 cross peak.
  2. Evolution1 -> {\"Echo\", refocusEvents}: splits t1 into t1/2 - \
refocusEvents - t1/2; applying a 180-degree 1H pulse in the middle refocuses \
J_HN while preserving 15N chemical shift.
  3. Evolution1 -> {\"ConstantTime\", tCT, refocusEvents}: keeps total \
indirect duration fixed at tCT via (tCT + t1)/2 - refocus - (tCT - t1)/2 \
(requiring tCT >= t1_max). Using a simultaneous 180-degree {1H, 15N} pulse \
keeps J-modulation constant across t1 while encoding 15N shift over t1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"783cab46-f158-f94f-afb1-811321a008bf"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sigFree", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Signal2D", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "48"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
