Cell["\<\
Signal2D::quadconflict : QuadratureMethod -> EchoAntiEcho with \
QuadratureOrder -> 1 and AutomaticQuadratureEncoding -> True conflicts with \
explicit CoherencePathway {-1} (requires both -q and +q pathways).\
\>", "Message", "MSG",ExpressionUUID->"99cc120d-ead5-7b49-9d74-f1d94ac6ae2a"],

Cell["\<\
Signal2D::zerochan : Quadrature channel(s) {AntiEcho} in QuadratureMethod -> \
EchoAntiEcho have zero or negligible signal norm relative to <|Echo -> \
9.96098, AntiEcho -> 0.|>. This can occur legitimately (e.g. an on-resonance \
indirect carrier w1 = 0, no indirect evolution, selective transfer, or \
ensemble cancellation) or due to Preparation/Mixing/CoherencePathway settings.\
\>", "Message", "MSG",ExpressionUUID->"7fb7173a-3732-be4f-b2fe-f6e3e47a2536"],

